"""Writes reference_pairs.json: pairs of products labelled by what a shopper would accept, NOT by what the Mieux taxonomy says.
valid   = a shopper would swap one for the other (same kind of product, same use)
invalid = a shopper would not (different product, form or purpose)
Labels were written by hand from product knowledge; they are not human-verified (see docs/alternatives-evaluation.md).
Run: .venv/bin/python3.9 tests/data/gen_reference.py"""
